(7077039, 1076579, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the photograph.  Great vibrant red, and I really like the hint of color in the eyes.  Nice detail as well.  <br/>(Voting later)</td>', 'Love the photograph.  Great vibrant red, and I really like the hint of color in the eyes.  Nice detail as well.  (Voting later)', '2013-07-25 22:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
