(7077372, 1076566, 134859, '<td valign="top">I have come back to this photo quite a few times, and have come to the conclusion that I REALLY enjoy looking at it.  There''s a mystery to it.  The angle of the shot, at first glance, makes the viewer wonder what exactly it is.  It took a minute to figure out you''re looking upward.  I love the light and burst of color; it compliments the reds.  The fog gives an eerie appearance.  Great editing and overall, wonderful shot!  One of my favorites in the challenge.  <br/>(Voting later)</td>', 'I have come back to this photo quite a few times, and have come to the conclusion that I REALLY enjoy looking at it.  There''s a mystery to it.  The angle of the shot, at first glance, makes the viewer wonder what exactly it is.  It took a minute to figure out you''re looking upward.  I love the light and burst of color; it compliments the reds.  The fog gives an eerie appearance.  Great editing and overall, wonderful shot!  One of my favorites in the challenge.  (Voting later)', '2013-07-26 10:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
